{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:22 2026-11-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:22 2026-11-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:22 2026-11-03 HKT</p><img alt=\"武漢住宅半夜爆炸，致2死1傷。新京報\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/39e9cfdcf9c6b90294b6b87df670a976/2026-11/New_Project__0.jpg\"/><p>湖北武漢有屋苑高層單位，11月2日晚發生爆炸，造成2死1傷。</p><p>《新京報》報道，現場為武漢武昌區一屋苑的居民樓，涉事單位晚發生爆燃，之後有明火。</p><p>3日，記者從武漢市公安局武昌分局獲悉，爆燃造成2人死亡，1人受傷，受傷人員沒有生命危險。目前，調查工作正在進行中。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:42:31.496432+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:22:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:59:11.923022+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:38:58.990874+00:00","content_hash":"69c3bb9cb751b886e1ea428fc637078e531374bbc599d0f078a5b4801551e6e6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}